              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dino Hunt is a commercial card game where players travel through time to capture dinosaur cards with point values."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Published by Steve Jackson Games in 1996, Dino Hunt frames set and point collection as educational time-travel dinosaur capture."
